# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Google AI Studio key — the free tier is sufficient.
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Defaults to gemini-3.6-flash: multimodal, returns bounding boxes in the
# [ymin, xmin, ymax, xmax] 0-1000 convention this app decodes, and has a usable
# free tier. Leave unset unless you have a reason.
#
# Note that gemini-2.5-flash, the previous default, is no longer accepted for
# newly issued API keys.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash

# Where runs are kept.
#
# Unset, the app writes to ./.data — no infrastructure, clone and run. Set this
# to a Postgres connection string and the app stores runs there instead, which
# is what a serverless deployment needs: its filesystem is per-instance scratch
# that does not survive a redeploy. Neon, Supabase and Vercel Postgres all have
# free tiers that fit. The schema is created on first use.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host/dbname

# Overrides the filesystem driver's location. Rarely needed locally; useful if
# the working directory is read-only.
# DATA_DIR=/var/lib/veda
